WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.260 --> 00:00:04.860
What happened when the Desire Camera took
a photo of SCP-049, the Plague Doctor?

00:00:04.860 --> 00:00:10.160
He was photographed standing in his containment
chamber, and the output was SCP-049 is embracing

00:00:10.160 --> 00:00:13.670
an unidentified approximately 6-year-old child.

00:00:13.670 --> 00:00:18.220
In the background various instances of SCP-049-2
are visible.

00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:20.960
What do you think is the true identity of
the 6-year-old child?

00:00:20.960 --> 00:00:22.800
Let us know in the comments.

